 Batch API
Batch API allows you to send multiple prompts to the model in a single request. This can be useful when you need to process a large number of prompts and want to reduce the overhead of making multiple requests.

To use the Batch API, you can create a JSON object with the following structure:
```json
{
  "prompts": [
    {
      "prompt": "Your first prompt",
      "max_tokens": 2048,
      "temperature": 0.5
    },
